Comment: 0,0:28:57.28,0:28:59.70,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Ending ===
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.28,0:28:59.70,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,And with that, we've reached the end of Sekaraji.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.70,0:29:03.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes, we're always waiting for your submissions to the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.52,0:29:08.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The address is sekairadio@pjsekai.jp.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.32,0:29:12.26,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Please check the official ProSeka X account for more details.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.26,0:29:14.98,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Please send in your emails as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.98,0:29:17.30,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,And don't forget to include your Radio name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.30,0:29:21.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Now, let's leave a comment in the contact notebook for the next cast members.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.51,0:29:22.01,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.16,0:29:25.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The next episode is scheduled to feature the VBS cast.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.48,0:29:26.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's VBS.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.71,0:29:27.21,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.21,0:29:27.71,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.76,0:29:29.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,As for our comment for them... let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.28,0:29:32.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,"What do you want to do before the end of the year?"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.41,0:29:32.91,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Haha!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.72,0:29:34.32,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really is the end of the year, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.56,0:29:38.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's only a little over a month left in this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.36,0:29:43.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. So I thought even if there's something they haven't done yet,\Nthey might just barely make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.12,0:29:48.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Since there's still a month left,\NI'd really like to ask them about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.84,0:29:49.74,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Do you have anything, Yui-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.74,0:29:50.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Something you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.71,0:29:51.21,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.60,0:29:54.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yui-chan wants to do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.00,0:29:55.60,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I want to redecorate my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.24,0:29:58.76,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,But there's no way I'll make it in just one month.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.65,0:30:00.15,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.12,0:30:02.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's definitely impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.56,0:30:03.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That takes a lot of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.52,0:30:05.16,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really does, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.16,0:30:07.80,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I'd have to clean up first and everything, so yeah.
Comment: 0,0:30:07.80,0:30:09.04,Yui Ogura,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.80,0:30:09.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's probably impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.24,0:30:10.14,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But I still want to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.14,0:30:10.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The motivation is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.12,0:30:13.24,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The sense of accomplishment afterward is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.36,0:30:14.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.20,0:30:16.32,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,We could even clean the hard-to-reach spots together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.00,0:30:18.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Ooh, that sounds nice too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.16,0:30:19.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Do you have anything, Hon-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.32,0:30:20.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I want to go to a hot spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.08,0:30:21.88,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,A hot spring, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.75,0:30:22.25,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.64,0:30:23.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Wait, couldn't you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.72,0:30:24.56,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,There's still time this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.56,0:30:28.48,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,If you have a month, surely you could manage one night away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.68,0:30:29.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I feel like I can make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.72,0:30:32.14,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I've been looking into it lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.14,0:30:34.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I have a lot of places on my list.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.80,0:30:39.18,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But whenever I think,\N"Oh, I could go here," my schedule doesn't quite work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.18,0:30:43.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Things keep overlapping,\Nso I'm aiming to finally go as a reward to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.20,0:30:45.08,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.08,0:30:46.12,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I hope you get to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.03,0:30:46.66,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.66,0:30:50.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Anyway, look forward to seeing how they answer next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.24,0:30:50.88,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Look forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.11,0:30:51.61,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.92,0:30:52.76,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,How was today for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.76,0:30:53.28,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Hon-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.96,0:31:00.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,We said it's been a while,\Nbut since we were practicing together for the Thanks Festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.08,0:31:02.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,talking to you just brings back all those memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.44,0:31:03.28,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Comment: 0,0:31:04.16,0:31:04.92,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.16,0:31:04.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.59,0:31:05.09,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.92,0:31:07.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really goes by in a flash, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.60,0:31:11.44,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It'll be next year before we know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.44,0:31:13.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Next up is already the 7th anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.20,0:31:14.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Isn't that amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.04,0:31:15.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.04,0:31:18.08,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,We've known each other for a long time now, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.35,0:31:18.85,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,We really have.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.51,0:31:20.01,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.04,0:31:22.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,When the four of us are together...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.00,0:31:24.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,How should I put it? The atmosphere...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.00,0:31:26.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It almost feels like we're a family now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.20,0:31:27.46,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's like being at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.46,0:31:28.44,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's so comforting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.60,0:31:29.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Like a family reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.96,0:31:32.64,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,We just talk and talk the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.64,0:31:37.08,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Oh, Hon-chan, that Setlog you did was really popular!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.95,0:31:38.58,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.58,0:31:39.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Was it okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.48,0:31:42.74,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Everyone was saying how much you were like Shizuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.74,0:31:48.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,They said the way you barely caught anything in the Setlog
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.00,0:31:48.64,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,was just like Shizuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.96,0:31:49.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.48,0:31:55.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Shizuku isn't good with technology,\Nso I'm glad it worked out that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.08,0:31:58.68,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Everyone was so happy, so let's take another one with the four of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.80,0:31:59.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I want a chance to redeem myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.68,0:32:06.22,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yui-chan messaged the group and invited us all,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.22,0:32:09.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,but at the time, I was like, "What's a Setlog?"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.16,0:32:16.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I looked it up and realized it was an app,\Nso I thought I'd download it before we met up again.
Comment: 0,0:32:16.48,0:32:17.54,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.48,0:32:17.54,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I downloaded the app.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.54,0:32:19.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,And I even made an account.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.24,0:32:23.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I thought I was all set, but when we met up that morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.92,0:32:30.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I hadn't done anything.\NThe concept of taking photos didn't even occur to me, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.15,0:32:32.65,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.64,0:32:33.55,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,My morning banana.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.55,0:32:34.09,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,In the morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.60,0:32:40.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Honn-chan, that one photo...\NThat was when Yui-chan showed me how to actually take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.48,0:32:45.26,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She looked at my screen and walked me through it,\Nsaying, "If you do this and that, you can take a photo."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.26,0:32:50.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She said, "There, you're all set!" so I just posted the banana\Nthat was right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.48,0:32:55.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I was like, "Okay, done!" and after that,\NI just focused on photobombing everyone else's pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.73,0:32:56.23,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.68,0:33:00.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, everyone was saying that was such a Shizuku thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.24,0:33:01.12,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.60,0:33:04.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Next time, I'll make sure to take a photo every hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.12,0:33:05.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'll definitely find something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.52,0:33:07.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,And I'll keep my phone with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.13,0:33:07.63,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.72,0:33:08.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'll get my revenge next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.04,0:33:09.68,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.72,0:33:10.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.28,0:33:13.60,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Well then, it's time for us to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.60,0:33:16.88,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Your hosts were Yui Ogura and Rina Honnizumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.08,0:33:17.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.75,0:33:18.25,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
